{"id":"local-solfeo-m12-c27","module":12,"number":27,"title":"Solucionario final · Preguntas 21-30","sourceTopics":["soluciones-final-3"],"sourcePages":[284],"pages":[{"title":"Solucionario final · Preguntas 21-30","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Solucionario final · Preguntas 21-30","pdfPage":284},{"type":"small","text":"<b>21.</b> Segunda mayor: dos semitonos.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":16},{"type":"small","text":"<b>22.</b> Tercera menor: tres semitonos.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":17},{"type":"small","text":"<b>23.</b> Se cuentan do-re-mi-fa: cuatro nombres, aunque fa esté alterado.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":18},{"type":"small","text":"<b>24.</b> Cuarta aumentada: seis semitonos.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":19},{"type":"small","text":"<b>25.</b> Quinta justa, siete semitonos; sexta menor, ocho semitonos.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":20},{"type":"small","text":"<b>26.</b> Séptima mayor de once semitonos y octava justa de doce.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":21},{"type":"small","text":"<b>27.</b> Doble sostenido eleva do dos semitonos; doble bemol baja mi dos semitonos. Becuadro restituye la altura natural correspondiente.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":22},{"type":"small","text":"<b>28.</b> Quinta disminuida; ambas abarcan seis semitonos en temperamento igual, con distinta escritura.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":23},{"type":"small","text":"<b>29.</b> Entonar el recorrido y conservar mi bemol al cantar el salto directo.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":24},{"type":"small","text":"<b>30.</b> Alturas de referencia, especie interválica, dirección, estabilidad y continuidad.","_sourcePage":"soluciones-final-3","pdfPage":284,"sourceBlock":25}]}],"practice":[],"vectors":{},"nextHref":"/solfeo-preview?class=local-solfeo-m12-c28"}
